  "english": "7. Tuesday, Tone 6 [GC/Gyut]: Feast of the Annunciation of the Holy Virgin. 6.\n19. Sunday, Tone 1 [AH/Aj]: Easter (Zatik). Day of the Resurrection of Christ. See according to the order in the First Volume. 22.\nMay\n28. Thursday, Tone 8 [DK/Dzag]: Ascension of Christ. See according to the order in the First Volume. 13.\nJune\n7. Sunday, Tone 2 [AK/Ats]: Coming of the Holy Spirit (Pentecost). 20. Fast-Bidding of the Elijah Fast.\n14. Sunday, Tone 1 [AJ/Aj]. First. Beginning of the Sundays of the Resurrection. [Hymn of the] Fathers, Tone 1 [AD]: \"Who came for salvation.\" 221.\nJuly 23.\n19. Sunday, Tone 4 [BK/Ben]: Sixth. [Hymn of the] Fathers, Tone 2 [BK/Ben]: \"Who descended from heaven.\" Fast-Bidding of the Transfiguration (Vartavar) Fast.\n26. Sunday, Tone 6 [BC/Gyut]: Transfiguration (Vartavar). The eating period is three weeks. See up to the Friday of the second week in the First Volume, and see here for Saturday 4. But see the [Hymn of the] Fathers of Sundays here. 1.\nAugust\n2. Sunday, Tone 2 [AK/Ats]: Second. [Hymn of the] Fathers, Tone 4 [BK/Ben]: \"Who [of the] heavenly hosts.\" Evening Hymn [Hambartsi], Tone 2 [AK/Ats]: \"Who was sent from the Father.\" 18.\n8. Saturday, Tone 8 [DK/Dzag]: The Holy Council of Ephesus of the two hundred Patriarchs.\n9. Sunday, Tone 1 [AJ/Aj]: Third. [Hymn of the] Fathers, Tone 5 [GC/Gyut]: \"We glorify You.\" Evening Hymn [Hambartsi], Tone 1 [AD]: \"Glory of the Resurrection.\" Fast-Bidding of the Fast of the Mother of God. 91.\n10. Monday, Tone 2 [AK/Ats]: Fast of the Holy Mother of God. [Hymn of the] Fathers, Tone 2 [AK/Ats]: \"Incomprehensible essence.\"\n16. Sunday, Tone 8 [DK/Dzag]: Assumption (Verapokhumn) of the Holy Mother of God. The eating period is three weeks. See this period in the First Volume, keeping the order of this place. 1.\n-\nSunday, Tone 4 [BK/Ben]: Exaltation of the Holy Cross (Khachverats). See up to...\n[Hymn of the] Fathers, Tone 7 [DZ/Dzag]: \"Those who hope.\"",
